","text":"Financial statement analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Be able to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Is this business generating sufficient cash and profit to repay its borrowing?"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Risk Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of banking risk."},{"type":"h","text":"Major risk categories"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Credit risk"},{"text":"Market risk"},{"text":"Liquidity risk"},{"text":"Operational risk"},{"text":"Cyber risk"},{"text":"Compliance risk"},{"text":"Fraud risk"},{"text":"Reputation risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer / Transaction","Risk Identification","Risk Measurement","Risk Classification","Controls","Monitoring","Reporting"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Compliance is a major part of modern banking."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"AML"},{"text":"Customer due diligence"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Fraud prevention"},{"text":"Suspicious transaction concepts"},{"text":"Data privacy"},{"text":"Cybersecurity awareness"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"},{"text":"Internal controls"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India-specific banking roles, candidates should study the current applicable regulatory requirements rather than relying on outdated exam notes."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Digital Banking"},{"type":"p","text":"Banking is increasingly technology-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UPI"},{"text":"Mobile banking"},{"text":"Internet banking"},{"text":"Digital onboarding"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Payment gateways"},{"text":"Core Banking Systems"},{"text":"Digital KYC"},{"text":"Fraud detection"},{"text":"AI-assisted banking"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital banking architecture"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer","Mobile / Web Banking","Authentication","API / Banking Platform","